    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know how it is \u2014 a lifetime of dreaming, struggling, chasing that one big break\u2026 and just when it feels like the world is finally at your feet, everything falls apart. <strong>Shit happens.</strong> Luckily, there\u2019s Uncle. And Uncle\u2019s got a motel.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><strong>Every day\u2019s the same:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making beds, taking out trash, fresh towels, a supply cart, and surprises no one asked for.   <br>Life\u2019s not fireworks. No success, no applause. But there\u2019s dark humor, sometimes even horror \u2014 and when those two mix, you get drama. <strong>Real-life drama.</strong>\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734400/extras/a3c0d129b9dc68e73a9dbb22c24964e3.poster.avif?t=1755612136\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734400/extras/a3c0d129b9dc68e73a9dbb22c24964e3.webm?t=1755612136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734400/extras/a3c0d129b9dc68e73a9dbb22c24964e3.mp4?t=1755612136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My</strong>\u00a0<strong>Style? Noir.</strong>   <br>Sometimes it feels like this whole thing is a mystery \u2014 just without the question. But I hold the camera. Where I point it, that\u2019s what I uncover.   <br>   <br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-Person Interactive Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Room Service Work Simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noir-Inspired Atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Storyline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival Elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-Solving Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Money-Earning System</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know how it is \u2014 a lifetime of dreaming, struggling, chasing that one big break\u2026 and just when it feels like the world is finally at your feet, everything falls apart. <strong>Shit happens.</strong> Luckily, there\u2019s Uncle. And Uncle\u2019s got a motel.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><strong>Every day\u2019s the same:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making beds, taking out trash, fresh towels, a supply cart, and surprises no one asked for.   <br>Life\u2019s not fireworks. No success, no applause. But there\u2019s dark humor, sometimes even horror \u2014 and when those two mix, you get drama. <strong>Real-life drama.</strong>\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734400/extras/a3c0d129b9dc68e73a9dbb22c24964e3.poster.avif?t=1755612136\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734400/extras/a3c0d129b9dc68e73a9dbb22c24964e3.webm?t=1755612136\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734400/extras/a3c0d129b9dc68e73a9dbb22c24964e3.mp4?t=1755612136\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>My</strong>\u00a0<strong>Style? Noir.</strong>   <br>Sometimes it feels like this whole thing is a mystery \u2014 just without the question. But I hold the camera. Where I point it, that\u2019s what I uncover.   <br>   <br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-Person Interactive Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Room Service Work Simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noir-Inspired Atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging Storyline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival Elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive Experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-Solving Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Money-Earning System</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Unknown actress takes a job at Uncle\u2019s Motel to make ends meet. She\u2019s running from trouble \u2014 but peace is the last thing she\u2019ll find here. A surreal blend of simulation, horror, and psychological depth, wrapped in a noir atmosphere.",
